@@ -7,12 +7,22 @@ name: Build Windows EXE
 #
 # Triggers:
 #   * push of a v* tag   → builds AND creates/updates a GitHub Release with
-#                          ViralCutter.exe (fpcalc + ffmpeg bundled inside)
+#                          OUSSAMA-Cutter.exe + checksums.txt (fpcalc + ffmpeg
